Paper macros for the multiplicity check (MultEx prefix; per stage 2 and block R: contrasts, intervals excluding 0, Holm and BH survivors), generated from runs/stage4_multiplicity; a stage that is not staged renders as the ?? marker

paper_data.multiplicity_view maps the analysis' per-stage summaries onto "orig" (stage 2) and "rep" (block R) through paper/results_sources.json (new group "mult"); paper_numbers.mult_numbers emits MultExOrig* and MultExRep* {Contrasts, Interval, Holm, Bh}. paper/generated/numbers.tex regenerated with python -m memshift.analysis.paper_numbers (eight added lines, nothing else changes). Also types two test helpers of test_multiplicity for mypy.

